  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "\"Standout Amenities of this Gorgeous Home<br><br>* Top floor balcony with Gulf views<br><br>* Stunning Private Pool- heated for a fee of $50/day<br><br>* Ping pong table and outdoor grill for family fun.<br><br>* Quick walk to South Spooky Lane public beach access.<br><br>* Nearby dining options include Shunk Gulley's, Pizza by the Sea, Goatfeathers, Local Catch, and The Perfect Pig.<br><br>* Professionally Managed.<br> <br>This property is not available to adults under the age of 25.<br><br>Sandy Shore Retreat is a beautifully designed multi-level home located south of 30A, offering Gulf views, private amenities, and close proximity to local attractions. The home has been newly refinished with coastal-inspired décor and luxurious finishes, creating a welcoming and relaxing space for your next vacation.<br>The expansive ground floor boasts three guest rooms, including a king-sized suite, a queen-sized room, and a bunk room with two twin/twin bunk beds—perfect for the kids. Two of these rooms provide direct access to the private pool, allowing for a refreshing swim anytime.<br><br>On the second floor, you'll find an open-concept living and dining area with a fully equipped kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances and a large island. Step out onto the first of two balconies for outdoor seating and views of the surrounding area. The dining area comfortably seats all guests, and the adjacent living room is perfect for cozy evenings with family and friends.<br><br>The third floor is dedicated to the luxurious Master Suite, featuring a king bed, en suite bath, and a private balcony overlooking the pool. Unwind here after a day at the beach, and enjoy the stunning Gulf views and sunsets.<br><br>Nestled along the picturesque 30A corridor, Sandy Shore Retreat offers the perfect balance of seclusion and convenience. Located just a short walk from South Spooky Lane public beach access, you'll have easy access to pristine, sugar-white beaches and emerald waters. The surrounding area is packed with locally owned restaurants like Shunk Gulley's and The Perfect Pig, serving fresh, coastal-inspired cuisine.<br><br>Take a short bike ride to nearby Blue Mountain Beach, Grayton Beach, or Seaside for boutique shopping, live music, and family-friendly entertainment. Whether you prefer quiet days lounging by the pool or exploring the vibrant communities of 30A, this home offers something for everyone.<br><br>Bedding Setup<br><br>Ground Floor:<br>Guest Room 1: King Bed<br><br>Guest Room 2: Queen Bed<br><br>Guest Room 3: Two Twin/Twin Bunk Beds<br><br>Third Floor:<br><br>Master Suite: King Bed with en suite bath and private balcony and a Daybed<br><br>Key Features of 30A<br><br>Beaches: Known for its crystal-clear waters, white sand, and iconic dunes, 30A's beaches are a top destination for families and beach lovers alike.<br><br>Dining & Entertainment: Sample the best of Gulf Coast cuisine at local favorites like Goatfeathers and Local Catch.<br><br>Outdoor Activities: Explore scenic biking trails, paddleboarding on nearby lakes, or enjoy outdoor concerts and events in Seaside.<br><br>Shopping: Visit nearby coastal boutiques and galleries for unique finds and beach-inspired décor.\"",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sandy Shore Retreat-Private Pool-Gulf Views"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
