            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind words, Travis! We're thrilled to hear you enjoyed the location and found the walk to the beach so convenient. It's wonderful to know the property met your expectations and that our team could provide the support you needed. We’d love to host you again in the future!",
