          {
            "date": "Aug 1, 2025",
            "id": "acb67d0b-7549-463a-9e05-5d5ff489e4f5",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your kind words and for sharing your experience! We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed your stay and found the home beautiful and accommodating for your group.\n\nWe appreciate your feedback regarding the pool area. Safety and comfort are very important to us, and we will look into addressing the slippery tiles on the back porch as well as the addition of a ladder for the steps. Your suggestions are invaluable in helping us improve the experience for our guests.\n\nWe hope to welcome you back in the future for another wonderful stay!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our stay was great! The home was beautiful and very accommodating for our group of 4 families! If I had any suggestions it would be the pool area- the tile on the back porch gets very slippery and there is no ladder for the steps.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
